   - $\sum_{j=1}^{10} w_j x_{7j} \leq 160$
   - $\sum_{j=1}^{10} w_j x_{8j} \leq 140$

2. **Integrality and Nonnegativity**:

   \[
   x_{ij} \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0} \quad \forall i \in S,\, j \in P
   \]

